[36m(TaskRunner pid=3939378)[0m    45'' = \frac{45}{3600} \text{ degrees} = \frac{45}{3600 \times 180} \text{ radians} = \frac{45}{648000} \text{ radians} = \frac{1}{14400} \text{ radians}
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3939378)[0m    \]
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3939378)[0m 
[36m(TaskRunner pid=3939378)[0m 2. **Effective Focal Length**:
